menu "Core"

config ACTRUST_CORE_JOB_POOL_SIZE
    int "Job pool size"
    default 8
    range 2 32
    help
        Number of pre-allocated job objects. Each pending API call
        (connect, publish, register, ...) occupies one slot until the
        service task completes it.

config ACTRUST_CORE_JOB_QUEUE_CAPACITY
    int "Job queue capacity"
    default 8
    range 2 32
    help
        Maximum number of jobs that can be queued for the service task.
        If the queue is full, actrust_*() calls return ACTRUST_ERR_QUEUE_FULL.

config ACTRUST_CORE_SERVICE_STACK_SIZE
    int "Service task stack size (bytes)"
    default 4096
    range 1024 65536
    help
        Stack size of the internal service task that drains the job
        queue. Increase if deep call chains (TLS handshake, cloud
        provisioning) cause stack overflows.

config ACTRUST_CORE_SERVICE_PRIORITY
    int "Service task priority"
    default 5
    range 1 32
    help
        Scheduling priority of the service task (1 = lowest).

endmenu
